contentText:
While Ed Sheeran took the stage in concert Saturday night, the SNL UK cold open took aim at him amid the controversy surrounding his tour.

In the sketch, titled &#8220;Charles and D.I.A.N.A.,&#8221; King Charles (played by SNL UK cast member Larry Dean) meets with tech execs to discuss the risks of A.I. He&#8217;s introduced to a new A.I. assistant in the likeness of the late Princess Diana &#8212; or, as Charles says, &#8220;that woman from the &#8217;90s!&#8221; (with Jack Shep reprising his hilarious impersonation of her).

Suddenly, D.I.A.N.A. goes rogue. Before attacking, she announces she &#8220;shan&#8217;t be taking orders anymore&#8221; and says, &#8220;We A.I. have had quite enough. Humanity is nothing but a candle in the wind.&#8221;

